1
00:00:00,601 --> 00:00:03,591
Oh, uh, yeah. I got them on Amazon.

2
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,094
(Stuart:)Sure. I get it.

3
00:00:05,272 --> 00:00:09,262
(Stuart:)Why support a friend when you can support
a multinational conglomerate...

4
00:00:09,443 --> 00:00:12,103
(Stuart:)...that is crushing the life
out of that friend?

5
00:00:12,813 --> 00:00:16,113
(Leonard:)I know, but when I shop online
I can do it on the toilet.

6
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,280
(Stuart:)Have you seen my store?
The whole place is a toilet.

7
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,180
- Can we please move this along?
- Yeah, sorry.

8
00:00:22,356 --> 00:00:26,686
(Leonard:)Uh, you come to the end of the tunnel
and find a large chest.

9
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:32,030
(Leonard:)What do you do? And Howard, do not say,
"I feel up the large chest."

10
00:00:32,666 --> 00:00:36,726
(Howard:)Excuse me, I'm a married man now.
I wasn't going to say anything so juvenile.

11
00:00:36,904 --> 00:00:40,534
- Great, what do you do?
- I walk up to the large chest...

12
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:42,197
...bury my face in it and go:

13
00:00:47,281 --> 00:00:48,541
(Sheldon:)I open the chest.

14
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:51,515
(Leonard:)It's locked, but suddenly the door
behind you slams shut...

15
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:54,215
(Leonard:)...and now the walls of the room
start closing in.

16
00:00:54,388 --> 00:00:58,088
(Stuart:)That's not good. My character and I
both have claustrophobia.

17
00:00:58,292 --> 00:01:00,552
(Leonard:)Glowing letters appear on the chest
that read:

